# This repository stores text with LF. Without this, a checkout on Windows rewrites every
# file to CRLF, and the next edit then shows up as a whole-file diff: twelve files were in
# exactly that state before the macOS port, hiding the real changes under 3,000 lines of
# line-ending churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# A shell script with CRLF line endings will not run: the shebang keeps the carriage
# return and the kernel looks for an interpreter that does not exist.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
